---
title: "Changelog"
description: "Notable changes to this website – themes, features, and structure. Not every commit."
date: 2026-11-01
image: /img/og/changelog.jpeg
---

{% set entryCount = changelog | length %}

<h1>{{ title }}</h1>

<p class="now-updated">{{ entryCount }} entries · newest first</p>

<p>How this site has changed over time. Only the stuff that matters to readers – new pages, themes, feeds, search, and the bigger infrastructure moves. For how the site is built, see the <a href="/colophon/">colophon</a>.</p>

<div class="changelog-list">
{%- for entry in changelog %}
	<div class="changelog-item">
		<div class="changelog-top">
			<span class="changelog-title">{{ entry.title }}</span>
			<time class="changelog-date" datetime="{{ entry.date }}">{{ entry.date | formatDateAdded }}</time>
		</div>
		{%- if entry.description %}
		<p class="changelog-body">{{ entry.description }}</p>
		{%- endif %}
		{%- if entry.links and entry.links.length %}
		<p class="changelog-links">
			{%- for link in entry.links %}
			<a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.label }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}<span class="changelog-link-sep" aria-hidden="true"> · </span>{% endif %}
			{%- endfor %}
		</p>
		{%- endif %}
	</div>
{%- endfor %}
</div>

<style>
	.changelog-list {
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.changelog-item {
		padding: 1rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-gray-20);
	}

	.changelog-item:last-child {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.changelog-top {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.changelog-title {
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.changelog-date {
		font-family: var(--font-family-monospace);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		white-space: nowrap;
		opacity: 0.7;
	}

	@media (max-width: 40em) {
		.changelog-top {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 0.2rem;
		}
	}

	.changelog-body {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
		opacity: 0.85;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.changelog-links {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
		opacity: 0.75;
	}

	.changelog-link-sep {
		opacity: 0.6;
	}
</style>
